{"skill":{"slug":"pipedrive-api","displayName":"Pipedrive"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790939500426,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":53442,"sha256":"f2bf5e2789f29e564d0e085f4202400500f96a800df0f3dc9d4a11f85c794848","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2082,"sha256":"56f86a29ba1e1d5e4689ef35620a1049f1827ffab9288a61b937f0f0c796d390","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790939806822,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"1cb940ef0af0632b363ffd265b2778b99c796c271bf269abf539c0e2a27828a3","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1cb940ef0af0632b363ffd265b2778b99c796c271bf269abf539c0e2a27828a3","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790939708516},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790939806822},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Pipedrive CRM integration that uses Maton OAuth/CLI workflows and gives clear approval requirements for writes, credentials, functions, triggers, and persistent forwarding.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requested Bash/Read/Grep/Glob access and network-backed CLI/API use are proportionate for invoking Maton and documenting API calls; the artifact contains no executable scripts.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI package commands via npm or Homebrew and requires a Maton account; this is disclosed and consistent with the stated integration model.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Instructions default to read/list operations, require explicit user approval for new connections and all POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE calls, and scope non-Pipedrive trigger references to user-requested automation only.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens persist in the OS credential store, and user-created functions, triggers, and destinations can persist as automations, but the skill repeatedly discloses those effects and requires explicit approval and least-privilege handling.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill can read and modify Pipedrive CRM records and can document hosted functions/triggers for automation, but those capabilities are coherent with a CRM integration and are explicitly described.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let an agent operate through your Maton-connected Pipedrive account. Review every write, connection creation, function deployment, trigger, or destination before approving it, because those can change CRM data or create ongoing data flows.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790939806822}}}}}